---
import {Image} from "astro:assets";
import Banner from "../assets/banner.avif";
import Default from "../layouts/default.astro";
---
<Default title="Help the Earth" desc="An environmental awareness organization focused on deforestation">
    <!-- Banner -->
    <Image
        src={Banner}
        alt="Campaign banner"
        class="w-auto"
    />

    <!-- Main content -->
    <main>
        <!-- Introduction -->
        <div>
            <h1>Help the Earth</h1>
            <p class="text-lg font-bold text-center">
                An environmental organization focused on raising awareness about the harmful
                effects of deforestation on our home planet.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Description -->
        <div>
            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>
                Deforestation is the intentional clearing of forested land, primarily for
                agriculture, livestock grazing, and urban development. It significantly impacts
                biodiversity, climate change, and the environment. It leads to far-reaching
                consequences that will end up affecting the future generation heavily.

                <br><br>

                The consequences of deforestation are severe from significantly contributing to
                global warming and climate change to threatening many species with extinction
                as approximately 80% of Earth's terrestrial animals and plants depends on forests
                for habitat.

                <br><br>

                We encourage people to fight against deforestation because the only we can fight
                against it is by working together as a whole. Even the smallest changes in our daily
                lifestyle can make quite the difference.

                <br><br>

                Every little action makes a difference. Just focus on doing as much as possible to help
                constantly.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Ways to fight against deforestation -->
        <div>
            <h2>How You Can Help</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg text-center">
                <li>
                    <b>Plant trees:</b>
                    Planting any kind of plants and trees in your local community
                    is a great way for anyone to fight against deforestation because basically
                    everyone can do it.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <b>Recycle and Reduce Waste:</b>
                    This reduces the need to harvest new raw materials e.g. timber and wood for
                    products. By recycling paper and wood, we can conserve forests and protect
                    ecosystems from the harmful impacts of logging.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <b>Spread Awareness:</b>
                    Inform as many people as you can about deforestation and it's harmful effects
                    and how they can help fight against it.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </main>
</Default>